## Local-only working files: plans, scratch notes, captures.
## Planning docs stay local and are never pushed.
/_local/
*.local.md

## Third-party test assets: texture packs and skins the user supplies for local testing.
## These are other people's art. They are read from disk at runtime and never committed.
/assets/texture packs*/
/assets/skins*/
*.mcpack

## Source artwork. tools/IconForge derives driftwood.ico, banner.png and the window icons from
## these and those derivatives are committed; the originals are megabytes apiece and nothing at
## build or run time reads them. Keep them locally to regenerate after an art change.
/assets/driftwood icon.png
/assets/driftwood banner.png
/assets/spell_icons_gitignore this.png
